\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Behold how pleasantly it is
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 that in this our marriage, Thou
\par Lord, Jesus is blessing it
\par It's signifying your great gift
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Plenty goodwill is descending
\par from your dwelling place always
\par Your relations, little children
\par All great people come together
\par And get united through marriage
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Such as the husband and his wife
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Come together in perfect love
\par And in holy covenant
\par Then their blessing is abundant
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj The heavenly host rejoice in it
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Owing to this their pure love
\par Whatever thing can separate
\par Them from the good blessing from God?
\par His blessing has united them
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  The man is like a buttressed tree
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 His hands shoot up just as branches
\par His wife looks like the vine tree
\par It always yield more fruits for them
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par God tends them and they multiply
\par And their descendants flourish
\par Lasting light shines for the husband
\par His turban reveals his glory
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  And God is ever pleased with it
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  With satisfaction, believe that
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 The root of marriage is from God
\par Our heavenly Father planned it
\par As for Him he loves all of us
\par And if we fall into trouble
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He is the one who helps us \tab 
\par What we like to do on our own
\par Manage and to get what to eat
\par All come out of your divine plans
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Misunderstandings and troubles
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj Are experienced in marriages
\par This leaves them in bitterness
\par But he who will put all his trust
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj Only on our God Almighty
\par Will get everlasting joy
\par Be cool  and calm, have your patience
\par In your troubles because our King
\par Makes our problems turn happiness
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.    Therefore our King, come to our side
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Come and advise us and bless us
\par Both in troubles and in joy
\par We shall give to Thee all our thanks
\par And sing our praises unto Thee
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Throughout all our lives long stay
\par In darkness, light, until the time
\par We meet in heavenly kingdom
\par So what we may glorify Thee.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

